# The UI test of scripts/laurel/ios26-autotest.sh. Docs: docs/laurel_sprout/ios26-autotest.md. Coordinates in panel pixels, 720x1560.
#   step NAME                     a new row of the table
#   wake                          power key, only if the panel is off
#   key power|volup|voldown|home [MS]    tap X Y [MS]    swipe X0 Y0 X1 Y1 [MS]    edge bottom|top|left|right [LEN] [MS] [AT]
#   open BUNDLE_ID                home   (the home key, then an edge swipe if the picture did not change)
#   wait SECONDS                  shot TAG
#   record N MAX_MS               starts a sequence shot, in the background, for the next gesture
#   stop                          waits for it, then finds frames that equal an older frame, and black frames
#   changed                       this step fails if the last two shots show the same picture

step unlock
wake
wait 2
shot locked
record 40 2500
edge bottom 800 300
stop
wait 2
shot unlocked
changed

step home-page-swipe
home
wait 2
shot page1
record 40 2500
swipe 620 800 100 800 300
stop
wait 2
shot page2
changed
swipe 100 800 620 800 300
wait 2
shot page1-again
changed

step control-center
shot before
record 40 2500
edge top 700 300 650
stop
wait 2
shot open
changed
record 40 2500
edge bottom 700 300
stop
wait 2
shot closed
changed

step settings
open com.apple.Preferences
wait 8
shot open
changed
record 60 3000
swipe 360 1200 360 300 300
stop
wait 2
shot scrolled
changed
home
wait 3
shot home

step safari
open com.apple.mobilesafari
wait 10
shot open
changed
record 60 3000
swipe 360 1200 360 300 300
stop
wait 2
shot scrolled
home
wait 3
shot home
